{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44036","headline":"有所思 · 刘云","name":"有所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝亦有所思，暮亦有所思。\n登楼望君处，蔼蔼萧关道。\n掩泪向浮云，谁知妾怀抱。\n玉井苍苔春院深，桐花落尽无人埽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}